# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
**/publish/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage*
**/*.coverage
**/*.coveragexml

# IDE / editor
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.userprefs

# Source control & CI
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes
**/.editorconfig

# Local tooling
**/.azure/
**/.devcontainer/

# Secrets & local config (defence in depth — should never be in source)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.snk

# Docs / repo metadata (not needed at runtime)
**/README.md
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/LICENSE
**/docs/

# Tests (Dockerfile only builds the Worker — tests would only inflate the image)
**/HoneyDrunk.Notify.Tests/
**/HoneyDrunk.Notify.IntegrationTests/

# Other solution scaffolding not consumed by the Worker build
**/coverlet.runsettings
**/Dockerfile*
**/.dockerignore
